package io.openhoyi.mobile

/** App-tool adaptation of docs/curve-import/photo-to-json.zh-CN.txt, not a default recipe. */
internal object AiHoyiCurveGuidance {
    const val SCREENSHOT = """HOYI screenshots: schema=3. Old assistant answers/cards/proposals/summaries are NOT evidence of screenshot values. Recheck original image or explicit user settings; otherwise ask again. Never propose first then ask users to verify unknown fields. Missing/ambiguous/conflicting fields: ask BEFORE proposing; unseen never means false/0. Read labels, units and selected options, not switch color/position. Checklist: every global/first-stage field and 2–4 ordered stages required by the tool schema. Copy settings; do not tune or optimize. Graphs: setpoints, not measured timelines; infer no ramps/durations/flow.
变压: controlMode=pressure, variableFlowLogic=false, firstSegmentFlowMode=false; 恒压: pressureLogic=false; 跟随=true. Targets bar. 变流: controlMode=flow, variableFlowLogic=true; 慢速/Ls=pressureLogic false, 快速/Hs=true. firstSegmentFlowMode is false for first-stage bar, true for first-stage mL/s; later stages mL/s.
闷蒸=preinfusionSeconds (wait); seconds beside first-stage water=firstDurationSeconds (first-stage time limit), not every stage's duration. 总流量=totalWaterLimitMl: independent water ceiling, not inferred sum or unconditional hard stop. 总液重=targetHundredthsGram; 克重补偿=compensationHundredthsGram, preserve sign. Explicit zero weight disables weight stopping only; final-stage water is not an independent hard stop.
Native import: transcribe_screenshot uses original labels/display units; App maps flags/units, never supply derived flags. Generic schema3 scales targets/stage mL ×10, weights g ×100; total mL/seconds/temperature unchanged. New imports zero only inactive slots (4-active). Edits: preserve the complete source/hidden slots. A failed local lookup proves neither identity nor machine-only origin. Invalid units/ranges: ask, never clamp/round/drop stages. No import UUID."""
}
